14", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/3c8f6255/uploads/origins/bbf8dce2-777d-4ebe-a191-df4801ee35e4?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=04f8e0b349de331430f7c33ed92305c1", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/3c8f6255/uploads/origins/bbf8dce2-777d-4ebe-a191-df4801ee35e4?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=04f8e0b349de331430f7c33ed92305c1, https://si.imgix.net/3c8f6255/uploads/origins/bbf8dce2-777d-4ebe-a191-df4801ee35e4?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=9bbc68bf303e88bdaca842074a794935 2x, https://si.imgix.net/3c8f6255/uploads/origins/bbf8dce2-777d-4ebe-a191-df4801ee35e4?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=f3e88c1dc5a2f3c6a7a0d9c579daf005 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "こんにちは、TwitterとSkebであなたのイラストを見て、あなたの画風がとても可愛いと思いました。私の友人のOC ( https://drive.google.com/file/d/1GJqOmFaOmyyVphGkOPd-FpogFgLDtTCn/view?usp=sharing ) のイラストをお願いしたいのですが、大丈夫でしょうか？\n\nポーズは何でも構いません。\n\nよろしくお願いします。", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@TreE__est/works/13", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/7f1e39a9/uploads/origins/b5b4bdae-c54b-4743-9e9a-6bcebef687f8?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=3f831f8742b856f365484d95b3470885", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/7f1e39a9/uploads/origins/b5b4bdae-c54b-4743-9e9a-6bcebef687f8?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=3f831f8742b856f365484d95b3470885, https://si.imgix.net/7f1e39a9/uploads/origins/b5b4bdae-c54b-4743-9e9a-6bcebef687f8?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=4437d84e335fc5ec5be0947aa679f3fc 2x, https://si.imgix.net/7f1e39a9/uploads/origins/b5b4bdae-c54b-4743-9e9a-6bcebef687f8?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=d5e21e30f9db755ca954197d6cff2e36 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body":